Package: pdfcombiner
Title: Graphical User Interface for Manipulating PDF and Image Files
Version: 1.9.8
Authors@R: 
    person("Steve", "Choy", , "steve.choy@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-5385-4096"))
Maintainer: Steve Choy <steve.choy@outlook.com>
Description: A 'shiny' app that supports merging of PDF and/or image files with page selection, removal, or rotation options.
    It is a fast, free, and secure alternative to commercial software or various online websites which require users to sign-up, and it avoids any potential risks associated with uploading files elsewhere.
